<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38646" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŏfundĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		profundus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>depth</i> (post - class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corporum tres sunt dimensiones, longitudo,
					latitudo, profunditas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 6, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Var. 2, 21</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>vastness</i>, <i>immensity</i>, Hadrian. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Vop. Sat. 8</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">disciplinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 7, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prudentiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 3, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingenii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 2, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Depth</i>, <i>intensity</i>, <i>darkness</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tenebrarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 20, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
